:: MMA Gym
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>><<npc Riley>><<person1>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessAsked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessAsked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymSparUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymSparUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaWeightsSessions is undefined>><<set $mmaWeightsSessions to 0>><</if>>
The MMA gym smells of sweat, disinfectant, and old rubber. Heavy bags sway along one wall, a cramped weights area sits beyond a rack of battered plates, and a square of mats at the back serves as Riley's class space. Nothing in here is polished for show.
<br><br>
It exists to wear people down and build them back up.
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop>>
<<else>>
	<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
		<<orgasmLocation "mmaGym">>
	<</if>>
    <<if Time.hour is $closinghour>>
		It is closing time. Riley starts shooing everyone toward the door.<<if $exposed gte 1>> Your stomach drops as you remember what state of dress you are in.<</if>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $openinghours is 0>>
		The building is dark and still. Without the music and shouting, the place feels bigger.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $openinghours is 1 and $exposed lt 1>>
		<<icon "physique.png">><<link [[Use the weights room (0:30)|MMA Weights Room]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gphysique>><<gathletics>><<note " Moderate fatigue" "red">>
		<br>
		<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked isnot 1>>
			<<if $mmaGymAccessAsked isnot 1>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask Riley about using the rest of the gym|MMA Gym Access Request]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask Riley for another assessment (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $combatExtended.standingFights is 1 and $combatExtended.footworkToggle is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1200>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a footwork lesson (£120 1:00)|Footwork Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<set $usedEvents = []>><<money -12000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gfootwork>><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a footwork lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $combatExtended.strikingToggle is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1800>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a striking lesson (£180 1:00)|Striking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<set $usedEvents = []>><<money -18000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<note "+ Striking" "green">><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a striking lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $combatExtended.kickingToggle is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1800>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a kicking lesson (£180 1:00)|Kicking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<set $usedEvents = []>><<money -18000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<note "+ Kicking" "green">><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a kicking lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1000>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a conditioning lesson (£100 1:00)|Conditioning Lesson 1]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<money -10000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gphysique>><<gathletics>><<gwillpower>><<note " Brutal fatigue" "red">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a conditioning lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="blue">Riley hasn't opened conditioning work to you yet.</span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Spar with Riley (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "spar">><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $openinghours is 0 and Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.mmaGym>>
		<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|MMA Gym Register]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[Leave|Nightingale Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>


:: MMA Gym Introduction
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You hover at the edge of the floor. "Uh... hello."
	<br><br>
	Riley gives you one look. "Speak up. This isn't a library." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin toward the others. "You want to train, get on the floor. You want to stand there looking lost, use the door instead."
	<br><br>
	Heat climbs up your neck. You hurry into line before <<he>> can dismiss you outright.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	You meet Riley's stare. "I'm ready."
	<br><br>
	"Good," Riley says. "Stay that confident when your legs start shaking." <<He>> points you toward the marked space. "Listen the first time and you'll waste less of mine."
	<br><br>
	You take your place while Riley starts the warm-up.
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	<<promiscuity1>>You let your gaze linger. "You greet all new students like that?"
	<br><br>
	Riley's mouth twitches. "Only the ones who mistake this place for flirting practice." <<He>> brushes past you. "Eyes forward. Hands up."
	<br><br>
	So much for that. The class moves, and you move with it.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$mmaGymIntroExit]]>><<unset $mmaGymIntroExit>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MMA Weights Room
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmaWeightsSessions is undefined>><<set $mmaWeightsSessions to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<set _failChance to 30>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 1000>><<set _failChance to 47>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 2500>><<set _failChance to 37>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000>><<set _failChance to 27>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 8000>><<set _failChance to 17>><</if>>
<<if $willpower gte 500 and _failChance gt 2>><<set _failChance to 7>><</if>>
<<if $athletics gte 700 and _failChance gt 2>><<set _failChance to 7>><</if>>
<<set _weightsThought to "You tell yourself the work is practical. More access, better training, more to gain from this place than a half-hour with the weights.">>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy" or $speech_attitude is "docile">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "You grit your teeth and force the bar back up. Stronger means harder to corner, harder to scare, harder to push around when someone decides you look easy.">>
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty" or $speech_attitude is "cruel" or $speech_attitude is "confident">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "The thought keeps flashing up between sets: beat Riley, shut the smug idiots up, and stop letting anyone in town think they can look down on you.">>
<</if>>
<<wearProp "weight">>
The weights room is cramped and noisy, all clashing plates and sharp corrections. Riley keeps you moving between rack, bench, and sled without leaving much time to recover.
<<print _weightsThought>>
<br><br>
<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
	The work gets away from you before the session is half done. Your form breaks, Riley stops you cold, and the restart feels worse than the first attempt.
	<br><br>
	"Again," Riley says. "If you get sloppy under a bar, you get hurt. Learn that now."
	<<physique 1>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<pain 2>><<gpain>><<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 8000>>
	The effort bites, but never quite takes control. You finish sore, breathing hard, and steady enough that Riley only needs to correct you once.
	<<physique 2>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 3>><<gtiredness>><<stress 2>><<gstress>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000>>
	By the end your limbs feel heavy and your shirt sticks to your back, but you keep your form together and get through the full session cleanly.
	<<physique 2>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	It is ugly work. Your muscles burn, your breathing turns ragged, and Riley has to keep dragging you back into proper position before you hurt yourself.
	<<physique 1>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 7>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<<set $mmaWeightsSessions += 1>>
<br><br>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked isnot 1 and $mmaWeightsSessions gte 2>>
	You catch Riley watching the end of your set with <<his>> arms folded. <<He>> does not praise you, but <<he>> no longer looks like <<he>> expects you to quit halfway through.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is 1 and $mmaConditioningUnlocked isnot 1 and $mmaWeightsSessions gte 6 and currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000 and random(1,100) lte 25>>
	<<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 1>>
	Riley stops you before you leave. "You are finally strong enough that I can start ruining your willpower properly too. Conditioning. Different kind of ugly. Interested?"<<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="green"><i>The conditioning lesson unlocked!</i></span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
Riley glances at the clock. "Enough. Wipe the bench down when you're done."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><<handheldon>><</link>>


:: MMA Gym Access Request
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<set $mmaGymAccessAsked to 1>>
You look past the weights room toward the bags and mats. "Can I use the rest of the gym too?"
<br><br>
A couple of regulars laugh before Riley can answer. "That one?" someone says. "Give it a week."
<br><br>
Riley cuts across them with a stare sharp enough to silence the whole corner. "<<pShe>> asked me, not you."
Then <<he>> looks you over. "More floor space means more chances to hurt yourself. <span class="red">So earn it</span>. Beat me in an assessment round and you can use the rest."
<br><br>
The laughter does not start up again.
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the assessment now (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><<pass 30>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Back off for now|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result
<<if $mmaRileyLastAction>>
	<<print $mmaRileyLastAction>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mmaRileyLastScore gte 3>>
		For a moment, it actually works. Riley's posture shifts and a few people at ringside stop looking bored.
		<<physique 1>><<athletics 1>><<ggphysique>><<gathletics>><<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
	<<elseif $mmaRileyLastScore gte 1>>
		It is not wrong, just not enough. You stay in the exchange, but it costs you, and your lungs start to burn a little hotter.
		<<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>>
	<<else>>
		Riley reads it instantly and punishes you for it. The hit snaps through you hard enough to remind you that this is not a game anyone here is going to soften for your sake.
		<<pain 12>><<ggpain>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge Start
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode isnot "spar">><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><</if>>
<<set $mmaRileyScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to 0>>
<<unset $mmaRileyRound1Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound2Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound3Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound4Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound5Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound6Order>>

<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode is "unlock">>
	Riley steps through the ropes and jerks <<his>> chin for you to follow.
	"Five reads. Two waves. Show me you can think, move, and keep your nerve when somebody better than you is trying to make you stupid."
	<br><br>
	The people near the ring go quiet in that eager way that means they expect a spectacle.
	<br><br>
	<<if $mmaWeightsSessions gte 3>>
		Your body still remembers the weights room. The bar, the sled, the burning repetition of it. At least you are not stepping in cold.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Riley rolls one shoulder and motions you in. "Again. Five reads. I want to see whether you learned something or just got lucky last time."
	<br><br>
	There is less laughter this time. More watching.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<set $mmaRileyRound1Order to random(1,6)>>
Riley circles first, relaxed, waiting to see how you choose to open.
<br><br>
<<switch $mmaRileyRound1Order>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
