<</switch>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>
<<set $mmaRileyRound2Order to random(1,6)>>
Riley clips your guard and crowds in, trying to turn the pace ugly before you can settle.
<br><br>
How do you deal with the pressure?
<br><br>
<<switch $mmaRileyRound2Order>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<link [[Reset your feet and make Riley come to you again|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You reset your feet instead of panicking, forcing Riley to come find you again on your terms.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Throw back immediately and try to win the exchange now|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You fire back immediately, more irritated than balanced, trying to win the exchange before it finishes forming.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Fight for position and lean into Riley's pressure|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You meet the pressure and fight Riley for position instead of giving ground for free.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
	<<case 2>>
