:: MMA Riley Challenge Intermission
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>
<<if $mmaRileyWaveScore gte 5>>
	Riley steps back just enough to study you properly. The look on <<his>> face is sharp, but there is something almost proud in it now.
	"You are progressing nicely. Do not ruin it by getting excited."<<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
<<elseif $mmaRileyWaveScore gte 0>>
	Riley says nothing at first. <<He>> just looks at you, unreadable, like <<he>> is deciding whether what <<he>> saw counts as potential or inconvenience.
	<br><br>
	"Again," <<he>> says at last.
<<else>>
	One of the gym-goers laughs, and this time another joins in. Riley does not shut them up. <<He>> only looks at you, waiting to see whether embarrassment will make you worse.
	<br><br>
	"Again," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $mmaRileyWaveScore to 0>>
<<set $mmaRileyRound4Order to random(1,6)>>
The second wave starts rougher. Riley does not bother easing you in now that <<he>> knows what you look like under pressure.
<br><br>
How do you answer the next engagement?
<br><br>
