<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>
<<set $mmaRileyRound6Order to random(1,6)>>
The last exchange comes when your breathing is rough and your body wants the simplest answer instead of the smartest one.
<br><br>
