:: MMA Riley Challenge Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>

<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode is "unlock">>
	<<if $mmaRileyScore gte 10 and ($mmaWeightsSessions gte 3 or currentSkillValue('physique') gte 4200)>>
		<<set $mmaGymAccessUnlocked to 1>><<set $mmaGymSparUnlocked to 1>>
		Riley pulls back first.
		"Good. You thought your way through it. Bags, mats, lessons. <span class="green">The rest of the gym is open to you now</span>. Mostly."<<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
		<br><br>
		The regulars who laughed earlier do not have much to say about that.
	<<elseif $mmaRileyScore gte 8>>
		Riley gives you a long look, then taps two fingers against your shoulder.
		<br><br>
		"Your reads are getting there. Your body isn't." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin toward the weights. "Use the weights room. Come back when strength catches up to nerve."
		<br><br>
		<span class="purple">You are closer than before, but not through yet.<span>
	<<elseif $mmaRileyScore gte 4>>
		Riley ends it without hurry. "You had moments. Then you let them go. Use the weights room. Build something worth trusting."
	<<else>>
		Riley shuts the exchange down with blunt finality. "Back to the weights room. You want more access, earn it with work instead of wishful thinking."
		<br><br>
		A couple of the gym-goers laugh, and this time you know exactly why.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $mmaRileyScore gte 12>>
		Riley gives a short nod. "Better. Now you look like somebody who might actually be learning."<<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
	<<elseif $mmaRileyScore gte 6>>
		Riley looks you over, unreadable as ever. "You held together longer. Keep doing that."
	<<else>>
		Riley reads you too easily and makes you feel every bad decision on the way there. "Hnh." <<he>> steps back. "More weights. More work. Then try again."
	<</if>>
	<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked isnot 1 and $mmaWeightsSessions gte 6 and currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5200 and $mmaRileyScore gte 8 and random(1,100) lte 35>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 1>>
		Riley tosses you a towel. "You are finally stubborn enough for conditioning. Ask when you want that to become your problem."<<npcincr Riley love 2>><<glove>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="green"><i>The conditioning lesson unlocked!</i></span>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to 0>><<set $mmaRileyScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to 0>>
<<unset $mmaRileyRound1Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound2Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound3Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound4Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound5Order>><<unset $mmaRileyRound6Order>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Conditioning Lesson 1
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "Conditioning Lesson 1">>
<<else>>
	<<pass 15>><<set _failChance to 8>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 7000 or $willpower lt 500>><<set _failChance to 20>><</if>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 4500 or $willpower lt 300>><<set _failChance to 37>><</if>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 2500 or $willpower lt 150>><<set _failChance to 57>><</if>>
	Riley starts you on tire flips. By the sixth rep your grip is slick and your back is already hot with strain.
	<br><br>
	<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
		The tire stalls halfway up and drags you down with it. Riley makes you reset and finish the set properly, which hurts more than the failed attempt.
		"Again. Sloppy effort still counts as sloppy effort."
		<<physique 1>><<willpower 1>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 3>><<gphysique>><<gwillpower>><<gpain>><<ggtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<<else>>
		You get through the set by brute force and stubbornness, ugly near the end but still moving.
		<<physique 2>><<willpower 1>><<tiredness 5>><<stress 2>><<ggphysique>><<gwillpower>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Conditioning Lesson 2]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Conditioning Lesson 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<pass 15>>
<<set _failChance to 8>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 7000 or $willpower lt 500>><<set _failChance to 18>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 4500 or $willpower lt 300>><<set _failChance to 35>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 2500 or $willpower lt 150>><<set _failChance to 55>><</if>>
Riley puts you on carries and sled work next. By now there is no such thing as recovered; there is only less tired and more tired.
<br><br>
<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
	Your legs wobble, the sled drifts, and Riley halts the drill long enough to make you start the length over from the beginning.
	<br><br>
	"If your feet go, everything goes," Riley says.
	<<physique 1>><<athletics 1>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 3>><<gphysique>><<gathletics>><<gpain>><<ggtiredness>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	You keep the line straight and force yourself through the full set without giving Riley a reason to stop you.
	<<physique 2>><<athletics 1>><<tiredness 4>><<stress 2>><<ggphysique>><<gathletics>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Conditioning Lesson 3]]>><</link>>

:: Conditioning Lesson 3
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<pass 15>>
<<set _failChance to 8>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 7000 or $willpower lt 500>><<set _failChance to 18>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 4500 or $willpower lt 300>><<set _failChance to 35>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 2500 or $willpower lt 150>><<set _failChance to 55>><</if>>
Medicine-ball slams and jump rope finish off whatever rhythm you had left. Your shoulders ache, your calves tighten, and Riley does not soften the pace just because the hour is wearing on.
<br><br>
<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
	The rope catches your ankles and the next slam almost slips from your hands. Riley makes you take a breath, then puts you straight back to work.
	<br><br>
	"You do not get cleaner by stopping," <<he>> says.
	<<athletics 1>><<willpower 1>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>>
<<else>>
	You keep moving through the burn, ugly but disciplined, and finish the rotation without dropping the pace.
	<<athletics 1>><<willpower 2>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<<gwillpower>><<gathletics>><<ggtiredness>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Conditioning Lesson 4]]>><</link>>

:: Conditioning Lesson 4
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<pass 15>><<set _failChance to 8>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 7000 or $willpower lt 500>><<set _failChance to 18>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 4500 or $willpower lt 300>><<set _failChance to 35>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 2500 or $willpower lt 150>><<set _failChance to 55>><</if>>
Riley ends the hour with burpees, sprawls, and one last miserable stretch of carrying weight after your body has already started bargaining with you.
<br><br>
<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
	You break before the session does. Riley catches it immediately and drives you through the final reps anyway, leaving you aching all over.
	<br><br>
	"That is why conditioning exists," Riley says. "So you do not fall apart the first time you're tired."
	<<physique 1>><<athletics 1>><<willpower 1>><<pain 3>><<tiredness 9>><<stress 4>>
<<else>>
	You finish the hour on stubbornness alone, lungs burning and limbs heavy, but still moving when Riley finally calls it.
	<<physique 2>><<athletics 1>><<willpower 2>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<<gwillpower>><<gathletics>><<gphysique>><<ggtiredness>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
Riley checks the clock. "Enough. Get water before you drop on my floor."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Footwork Lesson
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "Footwork Lesson">>
<<else>>
	<<pass 20>><<set _failChance to 8>>
	<<if $combatExtended.footwork lt 600>><<set _failChance to 21>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.footwork lt 400>><<set _failChance to 38>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.footwork lt 200>><<set _failChance to 58>><</if>>
	<<if $gymstage is 0>>
		Riley tapes lines across the floor and has you work pivots, resets, and quick angle changes until thinking gets replaced by repetition.
	<<elseif $gymstage is 1>>
		The second block is all movement under pressure. Riley crowds your space, forcing you to step cleanly or get clipped with a pad.
	<<else>>
		The final block is nothing but tired legs and one more demand: move properly anyway.
	<</if>>
	<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
		You cross your feet, lose your balance, and eat Riley's correction more than once before the sequence starts to settle into your body.<<gpain>><<pain 2>>
		<br><br>
		"Again," Riley says. "Bad feet get you hit first."
		<<footwork 6>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 3>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>>
		Your steps stay light and measured even when Riley changes the angle on you without warning.
		<<footwork 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 6>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>>
		You keep the pattern most of the time, though your feet still tangle when Riley speeds the drill up.
		<<footwork 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<else>>
		The drill fights you the whole way through. You keep having to slow down, reset, and build the rhythm again from the floor up.
		<<footwork 7>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<gfootwork>><<ggtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $gymstage gte 2>>
		<<set $gymstage to 0>>
		Riley lowers the pads. "Enough. Walk straight before you try walking fast."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Riley points back to the tape. "Next block. Do not start getting lazy now."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Footwork Lesson]]>><<set $gymstage += 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Striking Lesson
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "Striking Lesson">>
<<else>>
	<<pass 20>><<set _failChance to 8>>
	<<if $combatExtended.striking lt 600>><<set _failChance to 21>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.striking lt 400>><<set _failChance to 38>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.striking lt 200>><<set _failChance to 58>><</if>>
	<<if $gymstage is 0>>
		Riley starts you on mitt work, breaking each combination apart the second your guard drops.
	<<elseif $gymstage is 1>>
		The bag work that follows is heavier and uglier, all force and recovery while your shoulders start to burn.
	<<else>>
		By the last round Riley is forcing combinations out of you when your arms already want to hang loose.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
		Your punches start to loop wide and your guard slips. Riley stops the drill, resets your stance, and makes you throw it all again until the panic leaves your hands.<<trauma 2>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>
		"Power is cheap," Riley says. "Control is harder."
		<<striking 6>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 3>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.striking gte 600>>
		Your punches land clean and straight, with enough control left over to recover properly after each combination.
		<<striking 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 6>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.striking gte 400>>
		Most of your shots land well enough, though Riley still catches every moment your shoulders creep up with fatigue.
		<<striking 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<else>>
		You hit hard enough, but not neatly. Riley keeps taking the sequence apart and forcing you to rebuild it piece by piece.
		<<striking 7>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
	| <span class="green">+Striking</span><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $gymstage gte 2>>
		<<set $gymstage to 0>>
		Riley lowers the mitts. "That is enough. Shake your arms out and leave."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Riley jerks <<his>> chin toward the next bag. "Next block. Keep your hands up."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Striking Lesson]]>><<set $gymstage += 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Kicking Lesson
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "Kicking Lesson">>
<<else>>
	<<pass 20>><<set _failChance to 8>>
	<<if $combatExtended.kicking lt 600>><<set _failChance to 18>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.kicking lt 400>><<set _failChance to 35>><</if>>
	<<if $combatExtended.kicking lt 200>><<set _failChance to 55>><</if>>
	<<if $gymstage is 0>>
		Riley starts with target work, changing angles and heights fast enough that hesitation matters.
	<<elseif $gymstage is 1>>
		The next block is heavy-bag work, full-power kicks and quick recoveries back into stance.
	<<else>>
		The last round is balance under fatigue. Your hips ache, your standing leg burns, and Riley still wants clean technique.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
		A lazy recovery costs you your balance and Riley immediately makes you reset and do the sequence again until you can keep your feet under you.<<gpain>>
		<br><br>
		"If you cannot recover, do not throw it," Riley says.
		<<kicking 6>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 3>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>>
		Your kicks crack into the pads with good weight behind them, and you recover cleanly each time.
		<<kicking 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 6>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>>
		You land most of the set well, though a few slower recoveries earn you a sharp correction from Riley.
		<<kicking 8>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 7>><<stress 2>><<gphysique>>
	<<else>>
		Your form keeps slipping once the fatigue sets in. Riley has to keep stopping you before bad habits settle into the drill.
		<<kicking 7>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
	| <span class="green">+Kicking</span><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $gymstage gte 2>>
		<<set $gymstage to 0>>
		Riley steps back. "Enough. Stretch before your legs seize up."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Riley taps the next pad into place. "Again. Cleaner this time."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Kicking Lesson]]>><<set $gymstage += 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
